
### Create first trip
POST http://localhost:8081/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Goa Holiday",
  "destination": "Goa, India",
  "startDate": "2026-11-15",
  "endDate": "2026-11-20",
  "budget": 25000.00,
  "description": "A fun trip with friends"
}

### Get all trips
GET http://localhost:8081/api/trips


### Update trip ID 1
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Goa Holiday - Updated",
  "destination": "North Goa, India",
  "startDate": "2026-11-15",
  "endDate": "2026-11-20",
  "budget": 30000.00,
  "description": "Updated trip with friends"
}

### Get trip ID 1
GET http://localhost:8081/api/trips/1

